sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Driver as Driver
    participant App as Journey Frontend
    participant API as cptn_api (Django)
    participant GTFS as Core GTFS Tables
    participant Sidecars as CPTN Sidecar Tables
    actor Rider as Rider

    Note over Driver, Sidecars: Phase 1: The Offer & Generalized Routing

    Driver->>App: Submits Offer (Origin -> Any Destination)
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/journey/offer/
    API->>GTFS: CREATE Agency, Route (Generic Destination)
    API->>API: CALL ORS (Routing & Durations)
    API->>GTFS: CREATE Shape (Cache Polyline)
    API->>API: Spatial Query (Find Stops along Shape)
    API->>GTFS: CREATE Trip, Stop_Times
    API->>GTFS: CREATE Frequency (Auto-Return Logic)
    API->>Sidecars: CREATE Trip_Capacity (Seats, Status: Scheduled)
    API-->>App: Confirm Offer Created
    App-->>Driver: Journey is live 🚀

    Note over GTFS, Rider: Phase 2: Discovery & Booking

    Rider->>App: Searches for Ride (Any Destination)
    App->>API: GET /api/v1/journey/find/
    API->>GTFS: QUERY Stops & Stop_Times
    API->>Sidecars: FILTER where Capacity > 0
    API-->>App: Returns available Trip_IDs
    Rider->>App: Selects Trip & Hits "Request"
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/ride/request/
    API->>Sidecars: CREATE Ride_Request (Status: Pending)
    API-->>App: Request Sent

    Note over Driver, Sidecars: Phase 3: Acceptance & Capacity

    Driver->>App: Views Pending Requests
    App->>API: GET /api/v1/ride/requests/pending/
    Driver->>App: Hits "Accept"
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/ride/accept/{request_id}/
    API->>Sidecars: UPDATE Ride_Request (Status: Accepted)
    API->>Sidecars: DECREMENT Trip_Capacity.Available_Seats
    API-->>App: Acceptance Confirmed
    App-->>Driver: Rider added to manifest.
    App-->>Rider: Ride accepted!